<div class="checklist">
    <h3>Checkpoint — before moving on, you must be able to:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Say what a refactor is, and name the thing about your game that did <em>not</em> change</li>
        <li>Explain why a <code>static</code> field survives a scene load when an instance field does not</li>
        <li>Explain why the duplicate branch needs <code>original != this</code>, and why it needs <code>return</code></li>
        <li>Say why the ceiling and the death rule had to move with the values they protect</li>
        <li>Find call sites by deleting a field and compiling, instead of searching by hand</li>
        <li>Commit and push</li>
    </ul>
